repository-code: "https://github.com/OmniPotentRPC/rgflux"
version: "0.2.1"
date-released: 2026-11-22
license: MIT
keywords:
  - kinetics
  - transition-state
  - rare-events
  - molecular-dynamics
abstract: >-
  rgflux computes rare-event kinetics on top of rgsaddle (bands,
  minimum-mode and index-1 saddle searches) and rgmin (first-order and
  Riemannian steppers), with rgpot static potentials, MD sessions, and
  direct lammpc sessions as optional features.
